      "start": -720,
      "details": "<p>The ethnic name is restored from the personal name {m}<em>ku-uz-zu-ra-ak</em>. The name, as preserved, is L\u00da.<em>ku-u</em>[<em>z</em>-...]. A. Bagg (RGTC 7/1, 150) tentatively suggests that\u00a0<span>{m}</span><span><em>ku-uz-zu-ra-ak</em> could be an error for\u00a0<span>L\u00da.</span><span><em>ku-uz-zu-ra</em>-[<em>a-a</em>].</span></span></p>",
